    <title>Useful</title>
    <updated>2026-11-22T00:37:40Z</updated>
    <link rel="alternate" href="https://positivitybriefing.com/#item-1" type="text/html"/>
    <content type="xhtml">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">In medieval Europe, water-powered mills did more than grind grain: millwrights adapted cams to drive hammers, automating work such as fulling cloth.</div>
    </content>
  </entry>
  <entry>
    <id>https://positivitybriefing.com/feed.atom#143a798f59944221e00e4541391f3b2da0e5b27ecb6549674bb8d7c84480f86b</id>
    <title>Hopeful</title>
    <updated>2026-11-22T00:37:40Z</updated>
    <link rel="alternate" href="https://positivitybriefing.com/#item-2" type="text/html"/>
    <content type="xhtml">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">A neighbourhood tool library turns occasional-use drills and ladders into shared resources; borrowing locally can make repairs easier without every household buying its own kit.</div>
    </content>
  </entry>
  <entry>
    <id>https://positivitybriefing.com/feed.atom#cb044e929db27d26f1129ed54d75841ddd64755e2a8daba980756f5d4846fb77</id>
    <title>Action</title>
    <updated>2026-11-22T00:37:40Z</updated>
    <link rel="alternate" href="https://positivitybriefing.com/#item-3" type="text/html"/>
    <content type="xhtml">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Spend two minutes checking a mug’s handle for a hairline crack; if it’s sound, wipe away tea stains with a damp cloth and return it ready to use.</div>
    </content>
